This repository contains board-adaptation work derived from OpenXiangShan
minjie-playground and env-scripts. Upstream revision information and original
project links are recorded in manifests/upstream-versions.md.

The board constraints and DDR configuration target the Phine Design
PD-VU19P-2-LSI Solo platform with a UV-FMCH-PDDR4DME daughter card installed
at FMC2.
